  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: S6-B  GEAR
  body: 'Press 3 (Melee), TAP left-click: that troop pauses a moment to show the
    item, then equips it (cyan cube above its head). Then press Z to target the dummy
    and TAP again with the same group.

    EXPECT: the equipped troop deals 15 per
    hit, other troops 10. Any troop type can equip gear, up to 4 pieces. An ''Army
    strength'' popup shows the percentage.'
  radius: 3
