  title: S6-E  CARRIER KILLED
  body: 'TAP left-click once. The troop grabs the gold and pauses briefly to show
    it (yellow ball). During that pause press M: a killer enemy appears right next
    to it.

    EXPECT: the troop dies (''Lost!''), the gold DROPS where it fell
    and can be collected again. Press M to remove the enemy.'
  radius: 3
