--- !u!114 &760300125
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 760300123}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>CONTROLS</b>

    WASD move  |  hold RIGHT mouse + move = rotate camera

    ` 
    All    1 Builder    2 Ranged    3 Melee    4 Medic

    LEFT click: tap = send
    1 troop, hold = send the group

    RIGHT click: tap = recall 1, hold = recall
    the group

    LEFT + RIGHT together = SWEEP (steer troops directly)

    Z =
    target nearest / next (a targeted carried object freezes)    X = clear target
    (object resumes)

    Q = guard flag

    Ctrl: HOLD = plan a route (hold LEFT
    + RIGHT to draw it), RELEASE = save it, TAP = run it

    Waypoint ring = capture
    zone (blue = yours, red = enemy)

    Counters: movable = troops still needed
    (negative = extra), enemy = free attach slots

    K / L = flip a waypoint (S4)  
    E = wake enemy (S7)   M = killer (S6)   B = open walls (S7)

    F1 Hub, F2-F8
    stations 1-7   H hide help   F12 reset

    Esc frees the mouse cursor'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
