  title: S4-D  CAPTURE
  body: 'Walk into the red ring ahead, press ` (All) then Q to place a guard flag
    inside it with your troops.

    EXPECT: the ring turns blue after a few seconds
    (more troops = faster). The far blue ring has an enemy inside: it slowly turns
    RED.'
  radius: 3
