  title: S1-C  CHOSEN TARGET
  body: 'Press Z until the crate (far) has an outline, then TAP left-click. Press
    X to clear the target.

    EXPECT: troops walk past the closer enemy and go
    ONLY to the chosen crate. After X, a new dispatch goes to the enemy.'
  radius: 3
